description         Cargo plugin for linting your dependencies

long_description    \
    ${name} is a cargo plugin that lets you lint your project's dependency \
    graph to ensure all your dependencies conform to your expectations and \
    requirements. It can check for security advisories, disallowed or \
    unwanted licenses, banned or duplicate crates, and crates sourced from \
    registries you have not allowed.

